+# Plain HTTP for Internal Hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts: HTTPS is required everywhere, on all builds and network configurations, including internal-only hosts behind a firewall. The earlier exception for such hosts has been revoked, so plaintext HTTP is not an accepted communication mode, regardless of network isolation.
